   "cooked": "<h1>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tec-rewards-distribution-round-31-180423-to-050523-1\" name=\"tec-rewards-distribution-round-31-180423-to-050523-1\"></a>TEC Rewards Distribution - round-31  - 18/04/23 to 05/05/23</h1>\n<p>This period covers praise given between <strong>18 April 2023 and 05 May 2023</strong>. We allocated 261.35 TEC tokens for rewards, using our new distribution system which boosts non-paid contributors. Some praise accounts still haven’t been activated so the total amount below will be less than what we set aside to distribute.</p>\n<p>Out of the total rewards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>90% of the tokens were given as praise rewards <img alt=\":pray:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/pray.png?v=12\" title=\":pray:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n<li>7% distributed among quantifiers <img alt=\":balance_scale:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/balance_scale.png?v=12\" title=\":balance_scale:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n<li>3% assigned to the reward board <img alt=\":memo:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/memo.png?v=12\" title=\":memo:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This data has been reviewed by the Quantifiers and the Reward Board, and has been submitted for distribution to the <a href=\"https://xdai.aragon.blossom.software/#/rewardboardtec/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Reward Board DAO</a></p>\n<p>You can check out the <a href=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/CommonsBuild/tec-rewards/27a0d2b8c1a8518ed4fe22d3aa4d9c025842fd71/distribution_rounds/round-31/distribution_results/reports/round-31--general-round-analysis-report.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">full period analysis here</a>. <img alt=\":bar_chart:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/bar_chart.png?v=12\" title=\":bar_chart:\" width=\"20\"/></p>\n<p>This post will be open to the community for review for 48 hours then submitted to the Reward Board for final execution. <img alt=\":heavy_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/heavy_check_mark.png?v=12\" title=\":heavy_check_mark:\" width=\"20\"/></p>\n<p>The Rewards Distribution for this round is as follows:</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Username</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">Rewards in TEC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Isaac (enti)<span class=\"hashtag\">#1546</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">31.5458</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">bear100#9085</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">13.8492</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">GideonRo#3175</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">24.8251</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">natesuits#4789</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">11.4062</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">ygg_anderson#4998</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">14.7080</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Marathonmind#3078</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">13.5638</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">JHennyArt#2106</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">11.0085</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Mark D#6686</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">8.4559</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Tamarandom#9361</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">7.0475</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Nuggan#5183</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">5.0559</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">acidlazzer#5796</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">5.5862</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">m-r-g-t#8344</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">4.2184</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">danlessa#2831</td>\n<td style=\"text-a